        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25KM1luQkhVREUxUkdWVVltaDZaRkpXWVZoRGFGRRAB!2m1!1s0x3403e3b58728fbd3:0xe8b261cbd47706fb"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJ0_soh7XjAzQR-wZ31Mthsug/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT205M1JXaEVhbGwyWVZSdmNVdHJVelowUkVjeVEwRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "5 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "🇭🇰東涌酒店高質中菜😍\n\n𖧧 ˒˒ 紅燒乳鴿 $128\n外皮炸得極其香脆金黃\n肉質仍然保持鮮嫩多汁\nRoasted to a perfect golden crisp, the skin crackles with every bite while the 𝐦𝐚𝐫𝐢𝐧𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐝 𝐩𝐢𝐠𝐞𝐨𝐧 remains incredibly tender and succulent🦆🔥\n\n𖧧 ˒˒ 乾清棗皇糕 $88\n紅棗味道清甜而不甜膩\n口感軟糯紮實且帶嚼勁\n𝐒𝐭𝐞𝐚𝐦𝐞𝐝 𝐫𝐞𝐝 𝐝𝐚𝐭𝐞 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐜𝐨𝐜𝐨𝐧𝐮𝐭 𝐦𝐢𝐥𝐤 𝐩𝐮𝐝𝐝𝐢𝐧𝐠𝐬 that strikes the perfect balance of sweetness🤩 The texture is delightfully chewy and bouncy, showing off beautiful, distinct layers🤤\n\n𖧧 ˒˒ 生磨杏仁茶 $98\n入口質地非常絲滑細膩\n滿滿天然杏仁香很濃郁\nVelvety 𝐬𝐰𝐞𝐞𝐭 𝐂𝐡𝐢𝐧𝐞𝐬𝐞 𝐚𝐥𝐦𝐨𝐧𝐝 𝐬𝐨𝐮𝐩🤍 The natural aroma of freshly almonds is incredibly intense, and it’s a true classic done right😍\n\n𖧧 ˒˒ 酸辣花膠羹 $168\n花膠羹酸爽開胃口感棒\n每一口是滿滿膠原蛋白\nA velvety broth with a perfectly balanced tangy kick✨ The generous pieces of 𝐟𝐢𝐬𝐡 𝐦𝐚𝐰 are soft and gelatinous — pure comfort in a bowl😚\n\n𖧧 ˒˒ 當紅脆皮雞 $328\n外皮薄脆雞肉保持嫩滑\n不愧為采悅軒的招牌菜\n𝐂𝐫𝐢𝐬𝐩𝐲 𝐫𝐨𝐚𝐬𝐭𝐞𝐝 𝐜𝐡𝐢𝐜𝐤𝐞𝐧 here is a true masterpiece🍗 The skin is rendered to perfection— incredibly crunchy, releasing a burst of savoury aroma with every bite😽 Underneath, the meat remains remarkably tender and succulent, locking in all its natural juices🫶🏻\n\n𖧧 ˒˒ 大澳蜂蜜奶茶凍 $88\n大澳蜂蜜自帶獨特清香\n奶茶凍香濃滑溜甜度佳\nA creative twist featuring fragrant 𝐓𝐚𝐢 𝐎 𝐇𝐨𝐧𝐞𝐲 🍯 The 𝐦𝐢𝐥𝐤 𝐭𝐞𝐚 𝐩𝐮𝐝𝐝𝐢𝐧𝐠 is incredibly silky with a deep, robust tea flavour that isn’t overly sweet🥰\n\n𖧧 ˒˒ 欖菜薑米蛋白炒飯 $248\n炒飯鑊氣十足粒粒分明\n富欖菜鹹香和薑米辛香\n蛋白則提升整體輕盈感\nThe savoury 𝐩𝐫𝐞𝐬𝐞𝐫𝐯𝐞𝐝 𝐨𝐥𝐢𝐯𝐞 𝐥𝐞𝐚𝐯𝐞𝐬 and zingy 𝐠𝐢𝐧𝐠𝐞𝐫 bits create a fragrant harmony, while the 𝐞𝐠𝐠 𝐰𝐡𝐢𝐭𝐞𝐬 add a delicate lightness😋\n\n𖧧 ˒˒ 蜜餞西班牙黑毛豬叉燒 $308\n選用優質西班牙黑毛豬\n肥瘦均勻入口軟腍帶嫩\n蜜糖掛汁讓鹹甜感交織\n𝐁𝐚𝐫𝐛𝐞𝐜𝐮𝐞𝐝 𝐢𝐛𝐞𝐫𝐢𝐜𝐨 𝐩𝐨𝐫𝐤 with a beautiful fat-to-meat ratio🐷 The 𝐡𝐨𝐧𝐞𝐲 𝐠𝐥𝐚𝐳𝐞𝐝 provides a glossy, caramelised finish that melts effortlessly in your mouth — absolute char siu perfection🍯\n\np.s. 𝐞-𝐬𝐡𝐨𝐩可享有現金劵優惠 或 其他餐牌優惠💰",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
